{"id":"0af7324d-4484-4564-969e-a97b57519757","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"7c4612854c014ef2","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/bridge/debug-events.ts","baseline":{"blob":"f6f87a2942a4d0b05a98e486effec3767a6cd1e7","start":2886,"end":2993},"shape":{"type":"CallExpression","atoms":["serve","(","bridgeHub",",","\"","run.effects","\"",",","(","args",")","=>","(","{","\"","effects","\"",":","takeEffects","(","(","args","as","{","\"","run","\"",":","string","}",")",".","run",")","}",")",")"]},"context":{"before":"9e92e4af3727b748","after":"842b6e0756138e3c"}},"payload":{"text":"What a run did through the editor, kept here as it did it (runtime-fs.ts): its workspace's files. Taken as the run ends.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:14:59.230Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:14:59.230Z"}
{"id":"2201323a-1b28-4042-b81b-309eb254f5f8","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"fbff056fb0d99763","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/bridge/debug-events.ts","baseline":{"blob":"921029d93fd7869331f918b1e7449fca031b72e0","start":2289,"end":2343},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","ends","=","new","Map","<","string",",","{","\"","exitCode","\"",":","number","}",">","(",")"]},"context":{"before":"b180dea0680ec29e","after":"c7206506370cdac7"}},"payload":{"text":"How each session ended, as its DAP messages say (a debugger in this extension host — another's isn't seen): its exit\ncode (`exited`).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:15:02.661Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:15:02.661Z"}
{"id":"412b0404-f5ce-4b6d-b8a3-1e7bdec519f1","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"84e50de55ff1817a","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/bridge/debug-events.ts","baseline":{"blob":"f8bb2ba6394b5f85c41b9200afd14ed05532366e","start":0,"end":118},"shape":{"type":"ImportDeclaration","atoms":["import","type","{","AskEvent",",","CoverageEvent",",","ListeningEvent",",","RecordedEvent",",","StdinRequest","}","from","\"","@brianjenkins94/editor-api","\""]},"context":{"after":"c0caea8a87b335a1"}},"payload":{"text":"What every debugger's runs tell the editor — tsval's, and any interpreter plugged in as `run.debugger` (editor-contrib's\nstarting point, contrib/README.md) — read the one way: the run contract's custom events (@brianjenkins94/editor-api)\ninto what core shows and keeps.\n\n- `ask`: a capability stop's question, answered as capability-stops.ts says;\n- `recorded`: what an allowed call returned, to give back when it isn't made (editor-api/policy's recordResult);\n- `listening`: the run is a service on a port (`node.listening.<run>`: the running list);\n- `coverage`: what the run ran and what went through its sites, as it ends (`evidence.observed`: evidence.ts keeps it in\ngit; the Margin reads the event itself);\n- `effects`: its capability calls, each with how it was decided, an answer at the call among them (`evidence.effects`:\nevidence.ts puts them in the run's envelope, where they're its exceptions on record).\n\nA run a terminal started (`__startedBy: \"terminal\"`, its `__runId` the terminal's run) prints there — its `output`\nevents' stdout and stderr (`node.out.<run>`) — and reads what's typed there (`node.stdin.<run>`, the `stdin` request).\n\nAnd what Run means, whichever debugger it starts — each launch resolved here:\n\n- its policy (`__policy`): what its gated calls are decided by;\n- its rules (placed-rules.ts): what variables they set at their places (`__places`), and its arguments if one gives them;\n- a run in core's registry (`runs.begin`), known by one id from start to end — its end the run's, with its exit code\n(DAP's `exited`: extension.ts's `node.exit`). Not a live run, which isn't in the running list: it's told what calls\nreturned when they last ran for real instead (`__recorded`).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:15:06.614Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:15:06.614Z"}
{"id":"4b3193db-63ee-4c8a-98be-38b38ab22918","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"b39f6402f7b0e0d4","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/bridge/debug-events.ts","baseline":{"blob":"b5ff3c3f4944009cd06ecbfd53151956ef58a195","start":3609,"end":3641},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","policy","=","await","policyFor","(",")"]},"context":{"before":"35ba4cd7f5f4f592","after":"a07f40ab14a50d0a"}},"payload":{"text":"Every debugger decides its gated calls by the editor's policy (the run contract's `__policy`).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:14:55.774Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:14:55.774Z"}
